{"url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/", "text": "- Bamundi Mahavidyalaya\nBamundi Mahavidyalaya\nEmpowering Education for a Brighter Future\nEvents\nActivity\nAchievement\nবামুন্দী মহাবিদ্যালয়\nMenu\nAbout Us\nMission Vission\nIntroduction\nContact Us\nDepartments\nAssamese\nEconomics\nEducation\nEnglish\nPolitical Science\nAcademic\nAdmission Procedure\nCourses Offered\nDiscipline\nResults\nAcademic Calendar\nProspectus\nSyllabus\nClass Routine\nPrevious Questions\nDistance Courses\nIGNOU\nIDOL\nKKHOU\nIQAC\nIQAC Committee\nAbout IQAC\nMinutes of Meeting\nAQAR Files\nNAAC SSR\nStudent Satisfactory Survey\nFeedback Form Links\nBest Practices\nEvents & Activities\nNIRF\nCertificates\nActivities\nSeminar\nWorkshop\nCreative Writting\nDept. of English\nLibrary\nAbout\nFaculties\nTeaching Staff\nnone Teaching Staff Staff\nPublications\nResearch Paper\nAnuranan\nUttaran\nCollege Magazine\nDigital Resources\nRankings\nNIRF Rankings\nARIIA Rankings\nNAAC Rankings\nUpload Rankings\nBodies and Cells\nGovering Body\nGuidance and Counseling\nAntiragging Cell\nStudent Welfare\nNSS Cell\nExamination Cell\nYoga Cell\nWomen Cell\nStudent Welness Team\nInternal Complaints Committee\nStudent\nAcheivement\nProspectus (Admission 2026-27)\nNotice\nDate\nAdmission Notice\n11-05-2026\nEvents\nDate\nForm Distribution Ceremony (Nijut Maina)\n06-08-2026\nAwareness-cum-Mobilization Programme on DDU-GKY\n29-06-2026\nYouth Champion Training Workshop\n18-09-2026\nMessage from the Principal\nIt gives me immense pleasure to be the part of Bamundi Mahavidyalaya since I join the institution as a Lecturer way back in 2001. The college was established in the year 1997 to cater the need of kids of the poor village people. As they are unable to mitigate their problems sending their children to a distance place for higher studies before the existence of the institution. After its existence, the people of the locality could able to send their children for higher studies.\r\n                                As a principal, I am proud to be the family member of Bamundi Mahavidyalaya as the staffs always try to help the students to fulfil their hopes and aspirations and for that all staffs and students work hand in hand to get its dream fulfil and during the last 25 years of its existence, the college is progressing day by day with the help of the local people and hope the institution is able to help the students to fulfil their aims in near future like today\n×\n© 2024 - Bamundi College -\nPrivacy", "links": [{"label": "বামুন্দী মহাবিদ্যালয়", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/"}, {"label": "About Us", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/"}, {"label": "Mission Vission", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/about/"}, {"label": "Introduction", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/about/introduction"}, {"label": "Contact Us", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/about/Contact"}, {"label": "Departments", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/"}, {"label": "Assamese", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Departments/Assamese"}, {"label": "Economics", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Departments/Economics"}, {"label": "Education", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Departments/Education"}, {"label": "English", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Departments/English"}, {"label": "Political Science", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Departments/PoliticalScience"}, {"label": "Academic", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/"}, {"label": "Admission Procedure", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Academics/AdmissionProcedure"}, {"label": "Courses Offered", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Academics/coursesoffered"}, {"label": "Discipline", "url": "https://bamundimahavidyalaya.ac.in/Academics/discipline"}, {"label": "Re